{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t一輛九巴下午約3時駛到皇崗口岸時，懷疑撞到交通指示牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n運輸署回覆查詢時表示，關注事件，已要求專營巴士營辦商加強車長的駕駛和路線培訓，確保道路安全及暢順往返皇崗口岸公共運輸交匯處，維持口岸交通暢順運作。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:10.810442+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T13:41:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:49.847004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:22.628690+00:00","content_hash":"c1535743bd5416d41e02900d07946cbd5764bb2af6a6a7bb0e0fe3190ffba135","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}